# Complete Dashboard, Fleet, BOL, Currency, Mobile & Operations Overhaul

This updated plan incorporates all new requirements: Bill of Lading (BOL) generation, loaded litres tracking, spreadsheet import/export, system-wide USD/KES currency toggle, working search/filters, removing Leads & CRM, maximum mobile responsiveness (highlighting Fleet, Trucks, and Expenses), and increased font sizes across the platform.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Summary of New & Updated Requirements:**
> 1. **Auth First**: Login page is strictly required before any dashboard content is accessible.
> 2. **Fleet Table Sequence**:
>    `Dispatch Date` &rarr; `Truck Details` &rarr; `Capacity (L)` &rarr; `Litres Carried / Loaded` &rarr; `From` &rarr; `Destination` &rarr; `Product (PMS, AGO, DPK, etc.)` &rarr; `Driver` &rarr; `Transport (Revenue)` &rarr; `Mileage (Trip Cost)` &rarr; `Extra Expenses (Breakdown/Fix)` &rarr; `Balance (Profit = Transport - Mileage - Extra Expenses)` &rarr; `Status` &rarr; `Actions (BOL / Details)`.
> 3. **Bill of Lading (BOL)**: Generation of professional, printable fuel petroleum waybills / BOLs directly from dispatches and invoices.
> 4. **Import / Export**: CSV spreadsheet download (Export) and upload (Import) for fleet dispatches with a downloadable sample template.
> 5. **Default Currency & System-Wide Toggle**: USD ($) default with live toggle switch to KES (Kenya Shillings, e.g. 1 USD = 130 KES) in the topbar, dynamically converting all monetary figures across the entire system.
> 6. **Remove Leads & CRM**: Cleaned up from navigation and routing while keeping Invoicing fully active.
> 7. **Working Search & Filters**: Live search input and status filter chips on Fleet, Trucks, Expenses, and Drivers.
> 8. **Mobile View**: High responsiveness with a mobile bottom bar showing the 3 core items: **Fleet**, **Trucks**, and **Expenses**, with a slide menu for other modules.
> 9. **Increased Font Sizes**: System-wide font enlargement (sidebar, headers, table rows, and labels) for clear readability without tiny text.
> 10. **Products Page**: Dedicated Kenya fuel products directory (PMS, AGO, DPK, JET A-1, HFO, LPG).
> 11. **Trucks Page & Dynamic Drivers**: No static driver on vehicles; drivers placed on any truck during dispatch.
> 12. **Expenses Page**: Outside maintenance / garage expenses using **free-text inputs only (no dropdowns)**.
> 13. **Driver Salaries**: Issue per trip or per month with an interactive **Paid / Wait** click toggle.
> 14. **Monthly Reports**: Financial assessment of Profit, Expenses, and Salaries.

